l":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Accelerate product development","Support Edge AI applications","Extensive GPIO and peripheral interfaces","Multiple hardware form factors","Industrial deployment options","Large developer ecosystem","Flexible Linux operating system","Long-term product availability"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Raspberry Pi 5"},{"t":"p","html":"The Raspberry Pi 5 delivers a significant performance improvement over previous generations, making it ideal for Edge AI, robotics, industrial automation, computer vision, digital signage, and advanced embedded applications. With enhanced processing power, PCIe expansion, dual 4K display support, and improved I/O capabilities, it serves as a powerful platform for both development and deployment."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"Layer_1_1_\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"512\"><path d=\"m61.132 39.137-2.501-.584c-.132-.639-.301-1.271-.506-1.891l1.863-1.747c.312-.292.404-.751.228-1.142-.544-1.202-1.214-2.359-1.993-3.441-.25-.347-.691-.497-1.103-.372l-2.424.736c-.437-.49-.902-.956-1.394-1.393l.738-2.423c.124-.409-.025-.852-.372-1.102-.538-.388-1.095-.749-1.668-1.081v-17.697c0-2.757-2.243-5-5-5h-40c-2.757 0-5 2.243-5 5v26c0 2.757 2.243 5 5 5h10.573l-3.273 9h-5.3c-.553 0-1 .448-1 1 0 2.757 2.243 5 5 5h12.345c.146.221.277.452.432.667.25.347.689.497 1.103.372l2.424-.736c.437.49.902.956 1.394 1.393l-.738 2.423c-.124.409.025.852.372 1.102 1.08.779 2.238 1.45 3.442 1.994.391.177.849.086 1.142-.228l1.746-1.864c.618.205 1.251.374 1.892.506l.584 2.502c.098.417.449.726.876.768.674.067 1.343.101 1.986.101s1.312-.034 1.987-.1c.427-.042.778-.351.876-.768l.584-2.502c.641-.132 1.273-.301 1.892-.506l1.746 1.864c.294.313.753.405 1.142.228 1.2-.543 2.358-1.214 3.44-1.994.348-.25.497-.693.373-1.103l-.737-2.424c.491-.437.957-